isional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p017:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p017:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p017:m0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"謝淑妃","kind":"person","person_id":"ok2_ghf_354","status":"source_explicit"}],"source_position":{"first_line":52,"last_line":52,"revision_id":2506399,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/jin035-peixiu-peiwei/raw-projection.json","unit_key":"line052","raw_file_sha256":"b27aa9fc386b5f40990822d615febffcb8b8cd6df3fe6f74585274ff733c12be"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p018","text":"頠深慮賈后亂政，與司空張華、侍中賈模議廢之而立謝淑妃。華、模皆曰：「帝自無廢黜之意，若吾等專行之，上心不以為是。且諸王方剛，朋黨異議，恐禍如發機，身死國危，無益社稷。」頠曰：「誠如公慮。但昏虐之人，無所忌憚，亂可立待，將如之何？」華曰：「卿二人猶且見信，然勤為左右陳禍福之戒，冀無大悖。幸天下尚安，庶可優遊卒歲。」此謀遂寢。頠旦夕勸說從母廣城君，令戒喻賈后親待太子而已。或說頠曰：「幸與中宮內外可得盡言。言若不行，則可辭病摒退。若二者不立，雖有十表，難乎免矣。」頠慨然久之，而竟不能行。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p018:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"頠","kind":"person","person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_AAB","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p018:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"賈后","kind":"person","person_id":"jmv_vc4_gep_*AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整裴秀／裴頠單元的具名、當時職位及敘事事件與已錄同時期seed相合；不由單純同名自動合。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p018:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"張華","kind":"person","person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru","